      "problem": "Let $\\mathbf{a}=\\langle 3,3,-1 \\rangle$ and $\\mathbf{b}=\\langle 2,-7,0 \\rangle.$ Find the scalar projection of $\\mathbf{a}$ onto $\\mathbf{b}.$",
